Methods used to solve Arrays:

    1. 2 pointer
        -> opposite direction(sorted array)
        -> same direction(slow/fast)
    2. Sliding window
        -> fixed size
        -> variable size
        -> longest/shortest subarray/substring
    3. Prefix sum
        -> sum of subarray/substring
        -> sum of range
    4. Difference array
        -> range update
        -> range query
    5. Kadane's Algorithm
        -> max sum subarray
    6. Sorting & Traversal
        -> Merge intervals
        -> Custom Sorting Problem
    7. Frequency Counter/Frequency
        -> Anagrams
        -> Counting Duplicates
        -> Subarray with == sum